      "result": {
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "Compound III Ethereum USDC Comet:\nNo. In Compound III (including the Ethereum USDC Comet), supplying an accepted non-base collateral asset increases borrowing capacity (subject to that collateral’s collateral factor and supply cap), but the collateral asset itself does not earn protocol interest just for being supplied.\n\nProtocol supply interest is tied to the market’s base asset: a positive base-asset balance earns interest (and supplying the base asset first repays any existing base-asset debt).",
